  - HVG selection with Scanpy flavor=‘seurat_v3’, n_top_genes=3000, batch_key='domain' if available; flag .var['highly_variable']=True.
- Prior alignment (consumes PRIOR_RESOURCES; produces PRIOR_OUTPUTS)
