ave chosen hyperparameters and val ARI in cluster_metrics.json for auditability.\n\nImplementation notes:\n- Replace current neighbors calls with metric-aware versions and fixed seeds:\n  sc.pp.neighbors(adata, n_neighbors=k, use_rep=\"X\", metric=best_metric)\n  sc.tl.leiden(adata, resolution=best_res, key_added=\"leiden\", random_state=42)\n- Before building neighbors on adata_val/adata_emb, overwrite .X with the standardized (and optionally L2-normalized) matrix.\n- Ensure validation split truly reflects .obs[\"split\"] from the preprocessed AnnData (prefer reading preprocessed/adata_preprocessed.h5ad and pulling .obs[\"split\"]). Inaccurate val selection degrades ARI-driven tuning.\n\nSafeguards:\n- If all candidate (k,resolution,metric[,alpha]) produce degenerate clustering (1 cluster) on validation, relax k upward (e.g., add 50) and retry once before falling back to silhouette.\n- Cap runtime by short-circuiting the grid when ARI reaches >0.9 on validation."}</FEEDBACK>

